#: aequilibrae/project/about.py:10
msgid ""
"Provides an interface for querying and editing the **about** table of an AequilibraE project\n"
"\n"
"    .. code-block:: python\n"
"\n"
"        >>> project = create_example(project_path)\n"
"\n"
"        # Adding a new field and saving it\n"
"        >>> project.about.add_info_field('my_super_relevant_field')\n"
"        >>> project.about.my_super_relevant_field = 'super relevant information'\n"
"        >>> project.about.write_back()\n"
"\n"
"        # changing the value for an existing value/field\n"
"        >>> project.about.scenario_name = 'Just a better scenario name'\n"
"        >>> project.about.write_back()\n"
"\n"
"        >>> project.close()\n"
"\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"Fornece uma interface para consultar e editar a tabela **about** de um projeto AequilibraE\n"
"\n"
"    .. bloco de código :: python\n"
"\n"
"        >>> projeto = create_example(project_path)\n"
"\n"
"        # Adicionando um novo campo e salvando-o\n"
"        >>> project.about.add_info_field('meu_super_relevant_field')\n"
"        >>> project.about.my_super_relevant_field = 'informação super relevante'\n"
"        >>> projeto.about.write_back()\n"
"\n"
"        # alterando o valor de um valor/campo existente\n"
"        >>> project.about.scenario_name = 'Apenas um nome de cenário melhor'\n"
"        >>> projeto.about.write_back()\n"
"\n"
"        >>> projeto.close()"

